      "short": "Painting of two people with a red parasol on a flower-covered cliff above a blue-green sea with sailboats and clouds.",
      "long": "An oil painting depicting a seaside cliff covered in wildflowers and grasses. Two figures stand near the edge: one holding a bright red parasol, the other wearing light-colored clothing. Below them, a textured sea with white-capped waves contains numerous small sailboats. The sky is pale blue with scattered white cumulus clouds. Brushstrokes are visible throughout, especially in the foliage and water, creating a vibrant, lively surface.",
